    "description": "This skill should be used for comprehensive Telegram automation via Telethon API. Use for sending/receiving messages, monitoring chats, running a background daemon that triggers Claude Code sessions, managing channels/groups, and downloading media. Triggers on \"telegram daemon\", \"monitor telegram\", \"telegram bot\", \"spawn Claude from telegram\", or any Telethon-related request. IMPORTANT: Use `draft` command for \"драфт/draft\", use `send` for \"отправь/send\"; if ambiguous, ASK before sending.\n",
